{"id":"shanghai","name":"上海","en":"Shanghai","country":"China","lat":31.23,"lng":121.474,"dek":"江海交汇处的摩登与市井，层层叠叠","history":"上海从长江口南岸的渔村与市镇起家，十九世纪因港口位置与中外贸易迅速兴起。第一次鸦片战争后，它成为被迫开放的通商口岸之一，英租界、法租界相继建立，老城厢之外长出一片由外国人管辖的街区。外滩的建筑群、南京路的商业、租界的制度与人口，使这座城市在二十世纪初成为东亚最繁忙的港口和商业枢纽之一。\n\n1930年代，上海已是亚洲首要的金融与商业中心，租界内外聚集着工厂、银行、报馆、舞厅和里弄住宅。1937年淞沪会战爆发，城市经历激烈战事并随后沦陷于日军统治。战后内战接踵而至，1949年政权更替，大量外资与人员撤离，上海的城市功能被重新定位。\n\n冷战时期，上海的对外贸易多局限于社会主义阵营，全球影响力明显减弱。1990年代起，浦东开发与改革开放推动城市大规模重建，陆家嘴的天际线在短时间内成型，金融与外资重新进入。1993年上海地铁开通第一条线路，此后网络不断延伸，成为全球路线最长的城市轨道交通系统之一。","culture":"上海的文化身份建立在江南底色与近代租界经验的叠加之上。老城厢的园林、石库门里弄和外滩的折中主义建筑分属不同年代，却在同一座城市里相互嵌入。1990年代以后，浦东的高层建筑群与浦西的历史街区隔江相望，形成一种少见的城市景观：一边是金融城的天际线，一边是二十世纪初留下的街廓与江堤。\n\n当代艺术在上海的生长路径也带有改造旧空间的习惯。M50创意园设在普陀一处旧工厂内，1933老场坊由屠宰场改建，当代艺术博物馆则利用黄浦江边的老电厂。2019年，法国蓬皮杜中心在上海设立西岸美术馆分馆，选址于黄浦江畔的新艺术区。","pull":"江海交汇，旧里弄与摩天楼互相让路","sights":[{"name":"外滩","orig":"The Bund","intro":"黄浦江西岸的一公里多滨江地带，保留二十世纪初的银行、饭店与洋行建筑，对岸是陆家嘴的天际线。适合沿中山一路步行，看建筑立面和江面光线变化。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/A_picture_from_China_every_day_101.jpg/960px-A_picture_from_China_every_day_101.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":616},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%96%E6%BB%A9"},{"name":"豫园","orig":"豫园","intro":"始建于明代的江南园林，位于老城厢中心，以假山、曲廊、水池和花木组织空间。园外的湖心亭与九曲桥是旧城最具辨识度的角落。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Shanghai_-_Yu_Garden_-_0035.jpg/960px-Shanghai_-_Yu_Garden_-_0035.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":564},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B1%AB%E5%9B%AD"},{"name":"人民广场","orig":"People's Square","intro":"曾是英租界边缘的跑马场，现为市中心的大型开放空间。旧跑马厅会所改为博物馆与餐厅，地下是三条地铁线交汇的重要站点。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Peoples_Square.jpg/960px-Peoples_Square.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"龙华寺","orig":"龙华寺","intro":"上海地区历史悠久的佛寺，以古塔和钟鼓楼闻名。寺内香火延续，寺外周边在不同年代经历过明显改造，仍保留宗教场所的日常节奏。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Longhuasi.JPG/960px-Longhuasi.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":638},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Longhua_Temple"},{"name":"上海当代艺术博物馆","orig":"上海当代艺术博物馆","intro":"位于黄浦江边一座旧电厂内，2010年世博会期间曾作展馆，后成为中国大陆首家公立当代艺术博物馆。工业遗存与大体量展览空间并置。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Nanshi_Power_Plant.JPG/960px-Nanshi_Power_Plant.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":638},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E5%BD%93%E4%BB%A3%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86"}],"foods":[{"name":"小笼馒头","orig":"小笼包","intro":"上海与江南一带的皮薄馅大点心，包入猪肉和汤汁，蒸后趁热吃。常见吃法是先咬小口吸汤，再蘸醋。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Xiaolongbao_Shanghai.jpg/960px-Xiaolongbao_Shanghai.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1156},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%B1%A0%E5%8C%85"},{"name":"生煎馒头","orig":"生煎包","intro":"以平底锅煎制的小型肉包，底部焦脆，内馅多汁，撒芝麻与葱花。多在小吃店和早点摊出售。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/Shengjianbao_by_buncheduptv_in_San_Mateo%2C_CA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%94%9F%E7%85%8E%E9%A6%92%E5%A4%B4"},{"name":"红烧肉","orig":"红烧肉","intro":"五花肉与酱油、糖、酒一起慢烧，成菜色泽红亮、口感软糯。上海家庭与餐厅常见，讲究火候与甜咸平衡。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Food_%E8%80%81%E5%90%89%E5%A3%AB%2C_%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E8%8F%9C%2C_%E6%BB%AC%E8%8F%9C%2C_%E6%9C%AC%E5%B9%AB%E8%8F%9C%2C_%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%2C_%E4%B8%AD%E8%8F%AF%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9C%8B%2C_%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%2C_Shanghai%2C_People%27s_Republic_of_China%2C_PRC%2C_China_%2830166079710%29.jpg/960px-Food_%E8%80%81%E5%90%89%E5%A3%AB%2C_%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E8%8F%9C%2C_%E6%BB%AC%E8%8F%9C%2C_%E6%9C%AC%E5%B9%AB%E8%8F%9C%2C_%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%2C_%E4%B8%AD%E8%8F%AF%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9C%8B%2C_%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%2C_Shanghai%2C_People%27s_Republic_of_China%2C_PRC%2C_China_%2830166079710%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%B4%85%E7%87%92%E8%82%89"},{"name":"条头糕","orig":"条头糕","intro":"糯米制成的长条点心，常用豆沙作馅，外层裹粉，口感软韧。多由糕团店制作，作为茶点或点心。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Nanjing_three-color_cake_and_Shanghai_Tiaotou_cake.jpg/960px-Nanjing_three-color_cake_and_Shanghai_Tiaotou_cake.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%A1%E5%A4%B4%E7%B3%95"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Pudong_Shanghai_November_2017_panorama.jpg/1280px-Pudong_Shanghai_November_2017_panorama.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":640},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Shanghai_-_Yu_Garden_-_0034.jpg/1280px-Shanghai_-_Yu_Garden_-_0034.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":818}],"outline":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[120.8508584,31.1090894],[120.8525899,31.1049248],[120.8549108,31.102725],[120.8599748,31.102742],[120.8602156,31.1009724],[120.8640021,31.0991734],[120.8651018,31.0993617],[120.8653347,31.1013737],[120.8680282,31.1011375],[120.8686712,31.1027342],[120.8722881,31.1022846],[120.8717684,31.1002382],[120.8744154,31.1007842],[120.8736063,31.097678],[120.8875465,31.0965826],[120.8912108,31.0927348],[120.8920258,31.0888881],[120.8947828,31.0890882],[120.8981746,31.0879318],[120.8973334,31.0861972],[120.9005177,31.0814365],[120.898726,31.0804396],[120.8953142